  "about": "Risk rules for AI coding agents (Claude Code, Codex) collected by scripts/claude-code-hook.mjs. Each rule is one restricted-DSL rule of src/model.mjs (field contains value, case-sensitive); the collector lower-cases the resource and turns backslashes into slashes, so values are lower-case with forward slashes. A match is a signal for review, not a verdict.",
  "rules": [
    {"id": "risk.cred.etc-shadow", "group": "credential_file", "severity": "high", "value": "/etc/shadow", "title": "AI가 계정 비밀번호 해시 파일(/etc/shadow)에 접근했습니다"},
    {"id": "risk.cred.etc-gshadow", "group": "credential_file", "severity": "high", "value": "/etc/gshadow", "title": "AI가 그룹 비밀번호 파일(/etc/gshadow)에 접근했습니다"},
